      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "753K1",
      "text": "$2$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Expanding the two determinants, we get\n$\\left(1-3 x^2+2 x^3\\right)+\\left(3 x^2-x^3\\right)=0$\n$\\Rightarrow x^3+1=0$\n$\\Rightarrow x=-\\omega,-\\omega^2,-1$\n$x^{2007}+x^{-2007}=-1-1=-2$",
    "image": null
  },
